om2
note Interplane Live Hive Feed & Historical Model-Usage SVG Graph Engine
note Pure seeded Omega (om2): zero C, zero JS, zero trackers, fail-closed privacy.
note Modes:
note   --render <usage.tsv> <out_dir> [<catalog.tsv> <sync.log>]
note   --serve  <port> <usage.tsv> <catalog.tsv> <sync.log>

